WEBVTT

00:00:07.032 --> 00:00:08.773
[Po] Hey!

00:00:09.948 --> 00:00:13.038
[breathing heavily]

00:00:13.952 --> 00:00:15.388
Stairs.
爬楼梯累死了

00:00:17.651 --> 00:00:19.436
Who are you?
你是谁？

00:00:19.566 --> 00:00:24.353
Buddy, I am the Dragon Warrior.
老兄 我是神龙大侠

00:00:24.484 --> 00:00:26.051
[panting]

00:00:27.574 --> 00:00:29.663
You? [chuckles]
你？哈哈…

00:00:29.794 --> 00:00:31.796
Him? He's a panda.
他？他是一只熊猫

00:00:31.926 --> 00:00:35.756
You're a panda. What are you
gonna do, big guy? Sit on me?
你能怎样 大块头？
坐在我身上吗？

00:00:35.887 --> 00:00:38.455
Don't tempt me. No.
别惹毛我

00:00:38.585 --> 00:00:41.849
I'm gonna use this.
我手上有…这个

00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:43.590
You want it? Come and get it.
想要吗？来拿啊

00:00:43.721 --> 00:00:46.767
- Oh!
- Finally!
终于等到这一刻

00:00:49.291 --> 00:00:50.902
[chuckles]

00:00:51.032 --> 00:00:53.426
Yaaa! Whooo!

00:00:53.557 --> 00:00:59.214
- [growling]
- Ooh... [screams]

00:01:01.216 --> 00:01:03.175
- [snarls]
- [chuckles]

00:01:12.532 --> 00:01:14.186
That scroll is mine!
秘笈是我的！

00:01:16.405 --> 00:01:20.192
[both shouting]

00:01:34.380 --> 00:01:35.555
Oh!

00:01:43.607 --> 00:01:45.739
[screaming]

00:01:48.873 --> 00:01:50.222
[crashing]

00:01:52.311 --> 00:01:53.791
Whoa!

00:02:07.718 --> 00:02:08.980
Lightning!

00:02:11.286 --> 00:02:13.724
Aah! [chortling]

00:02:23.081 --> 00:02:26.258
[shouting]

00:02:36.398 --> 00:02:37.530
[gasps]

00:02:44.102 --> 00:02:46.495
[Tai Lung]
The scroll has given him power!
他练成无极神功

00:02:46.626 --> 00:02:48.410
No!
不！

00:02:52.023 --> 00:02:54.068
- Oh!
- [growls]

00:03:20.268 --> 00:03:23.663
[panting]

00:03:24.621 --> 00:03:28.537
Finally! Oh, yes.
终于…

00:03:28.668 --> 00:03:33.717
The power of the
Dragon Scroll is mine!
神龙秘笈的力量…
属于我的

00:03:37.808 --> 00:03:40.071
It's nothing!
什么都没写！

00:03:41.942 --> 00:03:44.641
It's OK. I didn't get it
the first time, either.
别难过 我刚拿到时也看不明白！

00:03:45.206 --> 00:03:46.468
What?
什么？

00:03:47.556 --> 00:03:49.515
There is no secret ingredient.
没有所谓的秘笈

00:03:52.823 --> 00:03:54.259
It's just you.
关键存乎于一心

00:03:58.219 --> 00:04:00.308
- [roaring]
- [screams]

00:04:01.396 --> 00:04:03.355
[laughing]

00:04:03.877 --> 00:04:05.009
Stop it!
不 别闹了

00:04:05.139 --> 00:04:06.706
I'm gonna pee.
我快尿出来…

00:04:06.837 --> 00:04:09.970
[laughing] Don't.

00:04:10.101 --> 00:04:13.582
- Don't! Don't!
- Yahhh!

00:04:41.436 --> 00:04:42.437
[meowing]

00:04:42.568 --> 00:04:43.787
[roaring]

00:04:50.184 --> 00:04:51.925
Oh!

00:04:52.056 --> 00:04:56.408
[roaring]

00:05:10.378 --> 00:05:13.599
[screaming]

00:05:18.909 --> 00:05:20.737
You...
你…

00:05:20.867 --> 00:05:23.174
...can't defeat me.
打不赢我的

00:05:27.526 --> 00:05:28.919
You...
你只不过是…

00:05:30.224 --> 00:05:31.748
...you're just a big...
…只…又大又胖的熊猫

00:05:31.878 --> 00:05:33.401
...fat...
…只…又大又胖的熊猫

00:05:33.532 --> 00:05:34.751
...panda!
…只…又大又胖的熊猫

00:05:35.664 --> 00:05:38.667
I'm not a big fat panda.
我不是普通的胖熊猫…

00:05:38.798 --> 00:05:41.192
I'm the big fat panda.
我乃独一无二大胖的熊猫

00:05:43.324 --> 00:05:44.804
The Wuxi Finger Hold!
无锡碎骨指！

00:05:44.935 --> 00:05:46.284
Oh, you know this hold?
你知道这一招？

00:05:46.414 --> 00:05:48.329
You're bluffing.
You're bluffing.
少来 你在唬我
师傅不可能教你

00:05:48.460 --> 00:05:50.331
Shifu didn't teach you that.
少来 你在唬我
师傅不可能教你

00:05:50.462 --> 00:05:52.116
Nope.
他是没教我

00:05:52.246 --> 00:05:54.553
I figured it out. Skadoosh.
我无师自通的 看招！

00:05:59.253 --> 00:06:02.822
- [all gasping]
- [wind howling]

00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:10.221
[chattering indistinctly]

00:06:14.878 --> 00:06:16.227
Look!

00:06:17.271 --> 00:06:19.447
The Dragon Warrior.
哇 是神龙大侠！

00:06:29.283 --> 00:06:30.981
[coughing]

00:06:33.244 --> 00:06:35.463
[all cheering]

00:06:46.735 --> 00:06:51.784
That's my boy! That big lovely
kung fu warrior is my son!
那个大块头的功夫大侠
是我的儿子

00:06:53.742 --> 00:06:54.918
Yes!

00:06:56.049 --> 00:06:57.790
Thanks, Dad.
谢了 老爸

00:07:06.799 --> 00:07:08.453
Hey, guys.
大伙儿

00:07:13.023 --> 00:07:14.328
Master.
大师

00:07:14.459 --> 00:07:16.026
[all] Master.
大师

00:07:18.811 --> 00:07:20.465
Master?
大师

00:07:20.595 --> 00:07:22.206
Master Shifu!
师傅！

00:07:26.863 --> 00:07:29.256
[panting]

00:07:35.088 --> 00:07:36.481
Master!
大师！

00:07:36.611 --> 00:07:39.049
Shifu, are you OK?!
师傅！师傅！你没事吧？

00:07:40.050 --> 00:07:42.356
[grunts] Po.
阿波

00:07:42.487 --> 00:07:44.315
You're alive.
你没死？

00:07:44.445 --> 00:07:47.535
- Or we're both dead.
- No, Master, I didn't die.
不 大师 我没死
我打败残豹了

00:07:47.666 --> 00:07:51.061
- I defeated Tai Lung.
- You did?
不 大师 我没死
我打败残豹了

00:07:55.239 --> 00:08:00.940
Wow. It is as Oogway foretold.
乌龟大师说得没错

00:08:01.071 --> 00:08:04.596
You are the Dragon Warrior.
你是神龙大侠

00:08:04.726 --> 00:08:07.599
You have brought peace...
你为这里带来了平静

00:08:07.729 --> 00:08:10.384
...to this valley...
你为这里带来了平静

00:08:10.515 --> 00:08:12.778
...and...
也为我…

00:08:12.909 --> 00:08:14.388
...and to me.
带来平静

00:08:14.519 --> 00:08:17.565
Thank you.
谢谢

00:08:17.696 --> 00:08:20.873
Thank you, Po.
谢谢 阿波

00:08:21.004 --> 00:08:23.789
Thank you. Thank you.
谢谢 谢谢

00:08:28.968 --> 00:08:34.104
No! Master! No, no, no,
don't die, Shifu, please!
不 大师 不…别死！
师傅 你别死！

00:08:34.234 --> 00:08:36.758
I'm not dying, you idiot!
我没死啦 你这笨蛋！

00:08:36.889 --> 00:08:39.109
Dragon Warrior...
我指神龙大侠…

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:45.202
...I am simply at peace.
Finally.
我只是…心静了
总算能静心了

00:08:46.681 --> 00:08:50.903
Oh! So, I should stop talking?
所以…我该闭嘴吗？

00:08:51.556 --> 00:08:53.210
If you can.
最好

00:09:10.967 --> 00:09:12.664
Want to get
something to eat?
要去吃些东西吗？

00:09:12.794 --> 00:09:14.622
[sighing deeply]

00:09:15.449 --> 00:09:16.668
Yeah.
好吧

